Or just text it.

10
00:00:57,579 --> 00:01:00,507
Every app ycyc learns, it learns once, for everyone.

11
00:01:03,479 --> 00:01:06,990
ParkMobile. Duolingo. Whatever you open next.

12
00:01:09,679 --> 00:01:13,999
Built today at YC, with Capy, Revyl, and Convex.

13
